    "title": "云店订阅&创建店铺",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<h2 id=\"%E4%BA%91%E5%BA%97%E8%AE%A2%E9%98%85%26%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E5%BA%97%E9%93%BA\" tabindex=\"-1\"><strong>云店订阅&amp;创建店铺</strong><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E4%BA%91%E5%BA%97%E8%AE%A2%E9%98%85%26%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E5%BA%97%E9%93%BA\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7%E8%AE%B0ai%E8%BF%9B%E9%94%80%E5%AD%98%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC%E9%83%BD%E8%83%BD%E8%AE%A2%E9%98%85%E4%BA%91%E5%BA%97%E5%90%97%EF%BC%9F\" tabindex=\"-1\"><strong>什么智慧记AI进销存版本都能订阅云店吗？</strong><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7%E8%AE%B0ai%E8%BF%9B%E9%94%80%E5%AD%98%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC%E9%83%BD%E8%83%BD%E8%AE%A2%E9%98%85%E4%BA%91%E5%BA%97%E5%90%97%EF%BC%9F\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h3>\n<p>不限制主服务版本，极速版和基础版都可订阅使用</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202405/a195692bd7d413048ba4079028922877.jpg\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"%E8%AE%A2%E9%98%85%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%E5%90%8E%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%E5%BC%80%E8%B5%B7%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8A%E5%BA%97%E9%93%BA%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E8%90%A5%E4%B8%9A%E6%89%A7%E7%85%A7-%26-%E7%AD%BE%E7%BD%B2%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE\" tabindex=\"-1\"><strong>订阅成功后即可开起线上店铺，需上传营业执照 &amp; 签署协议</strong><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E8%AE%A2%E9%98%85%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%E5%90%8E%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%E5%BC%80%E8%B5%B7%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8A%E5%BA%97%E9%93%BA%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E8%90%A5%E4%B8%9A%E6%89%A7%E7%85%A7-%26-%E7%AD%BE%E7%BD%B2%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202405/407f706d9bfac049e3ff42e92ae07a9d.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"%E4%BD%93%E9%AA%8C%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%88%E5%8F%AF%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%95%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%91%E5%BA%97%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD\" tabindex=\"-1\"><strong>体验账号高级版可直接试用云店功能</strong><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E4%BD%93%E9%AA%8C%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%88%E5%8F%AF%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%95%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%91%E5%BA%97%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p>注意：\n1.开通线上店铺需具备经营资质（个体户/企业）\n2.上架违规商品一经发现会关停店铺</p>\n",
